Upstream adds a timeout to the synchronous xilinx_spi_txrx_bufs completion wait. ADI has no such function or wait: it implements asynchronous transfer_one (xspi_start_transfer), completed by spi_finalize_current_transfer in its IRQ handler, with timeout managed by the SPI core. Applying this hunk would splice unrelated code into the runtime PM callback.
